  "disclosures": [
    "D1's configuration (ctxt_sparsity) was selected on the policy split among three pre-declared configurations; U had no such tuning (#127).",
    "THICK has no native success head on NovPhy (no reward signal; reward heads trained on zeros): no native-head score and no U + head control.",
    "The deterministic readout uses zero GateL0RD noise (upstream eval_ctxt_mean); upstream ctxt_always_sample would keep the noise on at evaluation.",
    "Training (selection, main seeds, D1-m, throughput) is float32 with TF32 matmul / convolution on the GPU, as the G-fid runs (Decision P-route, superseding the adapter decision's 'TF32 off'); every readout, selection-readout, scoring and validation path runs under deterministic_scoring() (TF32 off).",
    "D1-m scales every hidden width by one factor to U's parameter count; depths, latents and context native.",
    "Scoring waits for G-fid pass (#131 readiness gate); a G-fid failure drops D1 (fidelity_not_reproduced).",
    "P-novelty: after the primary scoring pass, every guard-passing arm (D1, D1-m; not the exploratory views) is scored on the #110 novelty levels from the E99 v1 anchor parse (--score-novelty); descriptive only, no tokens, never in a disposition."
  ],
